The '''Trellen Trade Route''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that ran from the [[Trellen system]] in the [[Core Worlds]], situated along the [[Hydian Way]], eastward to [[Zeltros]] in the [[Inner Rim Territories]], where it met the [[Great Kashyyyk Branch]] and another hyperlane.<ref name="Map" />
{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The partwork magazine issue [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 52|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 52]] places the [[planet]] [[Neimoidia]] on the Trellen Trade Route,<ref name="BMF">{{BuildFalconCite|52|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> although that name applied to a different route in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, and the route between [[Fedalle]] and [[Quellor]] was never named. [[Jason Fry]], author of ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''<ref name="Atlas">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref> and a number of maps in the [[canon]] continuity,<ref name="AVG">''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> has stated that this should be treated as an error.<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-08-31.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-08-31}}</ref>

